# L §8.1 HOLE-UNGOVERNED: "the gap rule: no row governs an input or a band at those keys on that law date"; the
# question for no keys is "x: no value at <law date>" (L §4.6 step 5).  The band's table governs from 2026-07.
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
band b(n: int): int
input one: int

version v
  cite s
  governs 2026-07..
  known 2026-01-01
  b: [0, inf) = 1

version d
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  one = 1

ask q1: b(one) law 2026-03-01
=== expect
q1: ?"b: no value at 2026-03-01" (b)
  law date 2026-03-01, cut 2026-12-31
